:''Not to be confused with [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)]].''
'''Shinji Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] who was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and was part of the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It is a variant of Baby Cat.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 415
|rarity = UR
